{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coreward is a fast-paced incremental game where you resist waves of enemies by rotating.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate your shields quickly enough to cover all angles, while you try to pick up the debris left by enemies when destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736220/extras/early_game.gif?t=1747838328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve yourself using the debris of the enemies you've destroyed. Widen your shields so they cover more ground, improve your core so it lasts longer, improve your debris collection... There's so many ways to get ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736220/extras/skill_tree.gif?t=1747838328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTROY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your upgrades to destroy more and more powerful enemies, and combine them for maximum effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736220/extras/late_game.gif?t=1747838328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THIS DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes a fraction of the dozens of upgrades available on the full game, enough to test your skill and give you a taste of the more advanced mechanics. Give it a spin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736220?t=1747838328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736220/4e5979c28c62fbdeb1d2520aa3e381dbd8690f96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747838328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736220/d76ff869c90878bea11f3c9aee709563a8fe7ace/cap